369d57a1736c370b17ac9530be73e1b589f69a9\nauthor Sandro <sandro.jaeckel@gmail.com> 1706052817 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1706052817 +0100\n\ndocs/reverse-proxy: use standard map, correct X-Forwarded-Proto variable for nginx","verified_at":"2024-12-03T16:56:07Z"},"event":"committed"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1933241158","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1698#issuecomment-1933241158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/1698","id":1933241158,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz885zOutG","user":{"login":"ohdearaugustin","id":14001491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDAxNDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14001491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin","html_url":"https://github.com/ohdearaugustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-08T01:51:06Z","updated_at":"2024-02-08T01:51:06Z","body":"> Also $http_x_forwarded_proto doesn't exist, NixOS uses $scheme instead and I am going with that.\r\n\r\nYeah probably only NixOS uses this config that way. You PR seems like it would only work for your NixOS setup. This wouldn't be helpful config for people not using NixOS. \r\n\r\nMy suggestion would be that you can add a comment, that if you run nginx on NixOS you would probably need to replace $http_x_forward_proto for $schema\r\n\r\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1933241158/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ohdearaugustin","id":14001491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDAxNDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14001491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin","html_url":"https://github.com/ohdearaugustin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohdearaugustin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1937076186","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1698#issuecomment-1937076186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/1698","id":1937076186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz885zdW_a","user":{"login":"SuperSandro2000","id":7258858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTg4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7258858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000","html_url":"https://github.com/SuperSandro2000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-10T17:20:18Z","updated_at":"2024-02-10T17:20:18Z","body":"> Yeah probably only NixOS uses this config that way.\r\n\r\nThat's wrong. NixOS' nginx config is pretty standard. http_x_forwarded_proto is a variable coming from the k8s nginx ingress controller, see https://docs.nginx.com/nginx-ingress-controller/configuration/virtualserver-and-virtualserverroute-resources/#:~:text=variables%3A%20%24scheme%20and-,%24http_x_forwarded_proto,-.%20Variables%20must%20be . In normal nginx this var doesn't exist.\r\n\r\n> You PR seems like it would only work for your NixOS setup.\r\n\r\nI didn't test this but I expect the snippet now to work with the majority of setups unlike before.\r\n\r\nThe NixOS specific code would look like\r\n\r\n```nix\r\nservices.nginx.virtualHosts.\"headscale.example.com\" = {\r\n  locations.\"/\" = {\r\n  proxyPass = \"http://127.0.0.1:${toString services.headscale.port}\";\r\n  proxyWebsockets = true;\r\n  extraConfig = ''\r\n    proxy_buffering off;\r\n  '';\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\nas you can see no special sauce is needed and the standard options defined for other websockets and proxies just work.\r\n\r\n> My suggestion would be that you can add a comment, that if you run nginx on NixOS you would probably need to replace $http_x_forward_proto for $schema\r\n\r\nUnless you are running headscale on k8s with the nginx controller then I don't know a scenario where that variable exists and even then it defaults to scheme https://github.com/nginxinc/kubernetes-ingress/blob/c503483ef20476f522850dbd6db32e38e2565cee/internal/configs/oidc/oidc_common.conf#L11-L14","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1937076186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"SuperSandro2000","id":7258858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNTg4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7258858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000","html_url":"https://github.com/SuperSandro2000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SuperSandro2000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/comments/1937084985","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/1698#issuecomment-1937084985","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/1698","id":1937084985,"node_id":"IC_kwDOEFLz885zdZI5